{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>OVERVIEW:</strong><br>Night Shippers is a cooperative horror game where you and your friends work as late-night food shippers in haunted Vietnamese neighborhoods. Outsmart cunning spirits, complete risky deliveries, and survive terrifying encounters inspired by local urban legends. Every night brings new challenges\u2014will you make it home with your earnings, or become just another ghost story?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CO-HORROR VIETNAMESE STYLE:</strong> Team up with up to 4 players to deliver food through atmospheric, supernatural city streets inspired by modern Vietnam.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SHIPPER SIMULATION:</strong> Experience the grind and hustle of being a food shipper\u2014one of the most familiar jobs in Vietnam and Southeast Asia.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ASIAN SETTING:</strong> Encounter ghosts and monsters based on contemporary Vietnamese and Asian folklore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>TEAMWORK &amp; COMMUNICATION:</strong> Coordinate with your crew to avoid dangers, outsmart spirits, and maximize your earnings before sunrise.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>REPLAYABLE RUNS:</strong> No two nights are ever the same\u2014delivery routes and supernatural threats are randomly generated for suspense and replay value.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3761880?t=1752475465","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3761880?t=1752475465","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761880/b6aa7b1c9799b8f0c766745ce3ba0af5b78379ca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752475465","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761880/b6aa7b1c9799b8f0c766745ce3ba0af5b78379ca/c